<title>PHILIPPINES: Boulevard gets approval as holding firm.</title>
<headline>Boulevard gets approval as holding firm.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Stock Exchange approved the reclassification of Boulevard Properties Holdings Inc to a holding company from a real estate developer, a statement from the bourse said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The stock exchange said Boulevard was reclassified under the holding sector on August 1.</p>
<p>The firm was also renamed Boulevard Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>Besides real estate development, Boulevard is now engaged in aviation, telecommunications, information technology, tourism and leisure hotel management.</p>
<p>Boulevard shares soared by 19.4 percent to 80 centavos in late Manila trade on Wednesday.</p>
